#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いまは校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All that's on it right now is the school crest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…
#. 罰があるんだろうな…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今まで取った画像も全部残してるんだろうか…
#. すごいデータ量になってそうだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder if they're keeping all the footage they've\n"
"taken so far. That'd be a lot of data, though...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
